  "text": "SMILE CLUB\nAFFORDABLE DENTAL CARE, EVEN WITHOUT INSURANCE!\n\nAt Cosmetic and Implant Dentistry Westport, we believe everyone deserves access to high-quality dental care, even without insurance. That’s why we created the Smile Club—to make treatments more affordable for all our patients. Call us today at (816) 388-0985 to learn more!\n\nSmile Club\nCALL CIDKC TODAY TO LEARN MORE ABOUT SMILE CLUB\n\nOur mission at Cosmetic and Implant Dentistry Westport is to make high-quality dental care affordable for everyone, especially those without dental insurance. By joining our Smile Club, you can enjoy significant discounts on essential dental treatments and services. To sign up or learn more about our Smile Club benefits, schedule a consultation by calling us today at (816) 388-0985!\n\nCHOOSE US FOR THE PERFECT SMILE\nCALL NOW",
